{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I was made for this!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your friend got an abandoned old bus. He asks for your help in converting it into a cafe. <strong>Can you handle it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/GetABus_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1746740608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Best job i've ever had!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up, wash away all the dirt, break up the old junk and <strong>create something beautiful out of this nightmare!</strong> Consider the requests of the customers, everyone will want to add their unique desires to your list of tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/FlipIt_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1746740608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How about some coffee?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can transform a bus into anything, even into a <strong>CAFE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/MakeAcafe_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1746740608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jack of all trades \ud83d\ude0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or even into a <strong>REAL motorhome!</strong> Wow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/OrAMotorhome_Super_Optimized.gif?t=1746740608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Great and small</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free t